        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> Psalm </STYLE> of <gr str="1732">David</gr>. <gr str="413">Unto </gr>thee will I <gr str="7121">cry</gr>, O <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>my <gr str="6697">rock</gr>; be <gr str="408">not </gr>
