      <VERS vnumber="7"> The <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> my <gr str="5797">strength </gr>and my <gr str="4043">shield</gr>; my <gr str="3820">heart </gr>
